@startuml state_candidate_pair
!include style.iuml
title State Machine: Candidate Pair

state RuleCheck <<choice>>
state ScoreCheck <<choice>>
state Generated #EEF1F5
state Scored #E2F3F1
state InReview as "In review" #FFF4E0
state MergedByRule as "Merged by rule" #E2F3F1
state AutoMerged as "Auto-merged" #E2F3F1
state MergedBySteward as "Merged by steward" #E3EEFA
state Reversed #FBE9E7
state NotDuplicate as "Not a duplicate" #EEF1F5

[*] --> Generated : blocking finds\ntwo similar records
Generated --> RuleCheck : rules R1 to R4
RuleCheck --> NotDuplicate : [different NPIs]\nor [different country]
RuleCheck --> MergedByRule : [same NPI or RPPS]
RuleCheck --> Scored : [no rule applies]
Scored --> ScoreCheck : model score
ScoreCheck --> AutoMerged : [score >= auto-merge\nand no open-cycle payments]
ScoreCheck --> InReview : [review band]\nor [open-cycle payments]
ScoreCheck --> NotDuplicate : [score < review]
InReview --> MergedBySteward : steward:\nsame doctor
InReview --> NotDuplicate : steward:\ndifferent doctors
AutoMerged --> Reversed : unmerge
MergedBySteward --> Reversed : unmerge
Reversed --> NotDuplicate : stored as\n"different doctors" label

MergedByRule --> [*]
AutoMerged --> [*]
MergedBySteward --> [*]
NotDuplicate --> [*]

note right of InReview
  Steward decisions become
  training labels (DEC-08).
end note
@enduml
